{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108305","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108305","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710830501:1":{"text":"队长！您回来了！快，这边有水。","source_cn":"队长！您回来了！快，这边有水。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4450DF1A27C2372D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710830502:1":{"text":"您已经连续战斗太久了，必须马上休息一下！","source_cn":"您已经连续战斗太久了，必须马上休息一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52F3D54B2F4CB618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710830503:1":{"text":"是啊，队长。剩下的交给属下吧，您——","source_cn":"是啊，队长。剩下的交给属下吧，您——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85889866E658D0A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710830504:1":{"text":"格温妮丝队长！那个……我们来支援了！","source_cn":"格温妮丝队长！那个……我们来支援了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B5DBC9B35F267E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710830505:1":{"text":"您还记得我吗？我是宫廷法师达利。","source_cn":"您还记得我吗？我是宫廷法师达利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75BF5D0B781CB578","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710830506:1":{"text":"当然，您提供的线索帮助了我。","source_cn":"当然，您提供的线索帮助了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF15CAB133210720A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710830507:1":{"text":"嘿嘿，那就好。哦，对，这位是我的搭档迪兹","source_cn":"嘿嘿，那就好。哦，对，这位是我的搭档迪兹","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E678951D9BEB95B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710830508:1":{"text":"向您致敬，格温妮丝队长。","source_cn":"向您致敬，格温妮丝队长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D23E15EDB290CAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710830509:1":{"text":"日安，魔法师迪兹。","source_cn":"日安，魔法师迪兹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BF215FD09653889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710830510:1":{"text":"您好，我有一个提议——依照目前的局势，仅靠物理防线很难保护住所有民众。","source_cn":"您好，我有一个提议——依照目前的局势，仅靠物理防线很难...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB01683AD892056A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710830511:1":{"text":"不知能否在剧场区域张开保护性极强的魔导屏障？","source_cn":"不知能否在剧场区域张开保护性极强的魔导屏障？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B76E3ED24594987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":